                        # the header stops reading as one flat hue (user's call
                        # 2026-09-26: "感觉都一样颜色不好看", then "从UI角度去选颜色").
                        #   cyan  = the TOOL / structure  -> [vbtop]  (matches [CPU])
                        #   green = the DATABASE           -> node name + version
                        #   blue  = the HOST / OS layer    -> "Linux <kernel>"
                        # Cyan/green/blue are also far from the alarm pair (red /
